     "html": "<math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><msup><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mover><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow></math>"
